{"version":1,"id":"ariana-grande-needy","title":"Needy","artist":"Ariana Grande","key":"A","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/ariana-grande/needy/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: King Crakk, Victoria, Ariana Grande and Taylor Monet Parks","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D7","canonical":"D7","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9,0],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Intro]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"If you take too long to hit me back","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I can't promise you how I'll react","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"But all I can say is at least I'll wait for you","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Lately I've been on a roller coaster","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Tryna get a hold of my emotions","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"But all that I know is I need you close","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'ma scream and shout for what I love","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":31,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Passionate but I don't give no fucks","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"I admit that I'm a lil' messed up","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":23,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"But I can hide it when I'm all dressed up","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D7","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm obsessive and I love too hard","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Good at overthinking with my heart","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"How you even think it got this far, this far?","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"And I can be needy (ooooh), way too damn needy (ooooh)","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"I can be needy (ooooh), tell me how good it feels to be needed","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"(Ooooh) I can be needy, (ooooh) so hard to please me","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"(Ooooh) I know it feels so good to be needed","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Sorry if I'm up and down a lot (yeah)","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Sorry that I think I'm not enough","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":0,"beat":0}